        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu dituku adi wewe wakatangila kudi bielelu bia nvita biakadi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge, Yehowa wa misumba, udi wamba ne, Ya biebe kudi mulami eu wa bintu, kudi Shebena mene, udi ha mutu ha nsubu wa mukelenge, umuebeshe ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Udi wenza tshinyi kunoko, ne udi ne muntu kai kunoko, bua wewe wakudiumbuila majambu? Wakudiumbuila majambu ha mukuna, wakadisongela muaba mu dibue bua yeye kulalamu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mona, wewe muntu mukole, Yehowa neakuhidie kule ne bukole buandi buonso. Neakukuate bikole, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neakuvunge tshivungu bulelela, nenkuele bu mudiye wela ndundu mu buloba bunene. Mu muaba wawa neufue biebe, ne mu muaba wawa nemuikale makalu ebe a mushinga mukole, wewe mufuishishi wa nsubu wa nfumu webe bundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenkûmushe mu mudimu webe, nebakutulule ku muaba webe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu dituku adi nembikile muntu wanyi Eleyakima, muana wa Hilekiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nemmuluatshishe tshivualu tshiebe, nemmujingile mukaba webe, nenfile bukokeshi buebe mu bianza biandi; ne yeye neikale tatu kudi ba mu Yelushalema ne kudi ba mu Bena Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenteke luvungula lua ku nsubu wa Davidi ha diaha diandi; yeye neutulule tshibi, kakuena muntu watshinshila; neatshioshile, kakuena muntu watshiunzulula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nemmujadike bu mudibo basa tshikudika mu muaba mushindame, ne yeye neikale bu nkuasa wa butumbi kudi ba mu nsubu wa tatuʼandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebakudike bujitu buonso bua tshiota tshia tatuʼandi hamʼbidi handi, bana bakalelabo ne bantu ba hatuhu baledibue kudi bana aba, dilonga dionso dia tshianana mene, ku makoho tô ne ku mbidiki yonso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa udi wamba ne, Mu dituku adi tshikudika tshiakadi tshiasa mu muaba mushindame netshihete; nebatshikose, netshihone hanshi, ne bujitu buakadi bukudikaku nebubutuke, bualu bua Yehowa wakuamba dî edi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
